     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br>\n\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">wow.<div><br clear=\"all\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>\n\nContact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  972-52-7275845<br>\n\nRead me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Bu1O88ZWkPu0nsjPYCjSI\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jcQB7fZPKzxLAOESpDWzV\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PTGzLziM7N3dNliPMj-np\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\n\n\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<div><div></div><div><br><br><br>\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2010/3/25 Jonathan Rosenblatt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">john...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\">\n\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">בעקבות השאלה המפתיעה שלך עשיתי קצת משחקים ונחרדתי לגלות שמטריצה יכולה להחזיק רשימה בכל תא...<br></div><div>matrix(list(list1=list(&#39;a&#39;), list2=list(&#39;b&#39;), list3=list(&#39;c&#39;), list4=list(&#39;d&#39;)), ncol=2)<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br><br><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2010/3/25 Liad Shekel <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">liad....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><div><div></div>\n\n\n\n<div><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-right:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);margin:0pt 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\">\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"direction:rtl\">לא נגד, פשוט שאת זה אני מכיר. </div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">תהיתי אם יש משהו אחר, שיותר נראה כמו טבלה.</div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">אין איזה מגה-מטריצה שיודעת לעשות את זה?...</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\n2010/3/25 Jonathan Rosenblatt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">john...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><div><div></div><div><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-right:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);margin:0pt 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">list<br>הוא מתאים בול לזה.<br>למה אתה נגד?<br><br><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2010/3/25 Liad <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">liad....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex\">שלום לכולם,<br>\n<br>\nיש לי כמה אובייקטים, נניח מודלים לינארים:<br>\nlm11<br>\nlm12<br>\nlm21<br>\nlm22<br>\n<br>\nאני רוצה מטריצה, שבכל תא תכיל את האובייקט עצמו.<br>\n<br>\nאיזה משתנה יכול לעשות את זה?<br>\n( לא list)<br>\n<br>\nתודה,<br>\nליעד<br>\n<br>\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to israel-r-user-group+<a href=\"http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2uCKToS9QQdauKyA1ynAVh\">unsubscribegooglegroups.com</a> or reply to this email with the words &quot;REMOVE ME&quot; as the subject.<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><br>-- <br>Jonathan Rosenblatt<br><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1OR4-UenBjzYLU6aY-tTQf\">www.john-ros.com</a><br><br><br>\n</div></div>\n\n<p></p>\n\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to israel-r-user-group+<a href=\"http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-ZN1PNKSqMdIntdvCXkRs\">unsubscribegooglegroups.com</a> or reply to this email with the words &quot;REMOVE ME&quot; as the subject.<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</blockquote></div></div></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><br>-- <br>:)<br>\n</div><div><div></div><div>\n\n<p></p>\n\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to israel-r-user-group+<a href=\"http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://unsubscribegooglegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-ZN1PNKSqMdIntdvCXkRs\">unsubscribegooglegroups.com</a> or reply to this email with the words &quot;REMOVE ME&quot; as the subject.<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div><div></div><div><br><br clear=\"all\"><br>-- <br>Jonathan Rosenblatt<br><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499011244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1OR4-UenBjz